    "title": "Popular Drive-Through Coffee Chain, 7 Brew, Set to Open in Clark - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sylvia Haley ,\n1 days ago Trendy drive-thru beverage chain, 7 Brew, is expanding to Northern Jersey and is opening a location later this year at 1005 Raritan Road in Clark. The property was leased to the 7 Brew developer this past January, and construction has been underway to complete the demolition of the now-closed Santander Bank. The spot is located on a busy corner between Raritan Road and Westfield Ave, which will drive business. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
